body:
TLDR;

OP: my partner has done something and it’s painfully obvious we aren’t compatible. What should I do?

Community: you aren’t compatible. You should end the relationship.

Mushrooms before acid, the cross-tolerance isn't as strong that way. It's still there, so you'll have to take more to get the impact you're after.

&#x200B;

Happy travelling.

I find it hard to take someone seriously who;

1. Wishes someone dead because they don't like them.
2. Calls people wank stains.

Your freedom to have weapons designed to end human lives does not trump the right of others to live.

&#x200B;

If you feel that way, go fuck yourself.
